# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contracts deploy/verify configuration is now consolidated into the repo-root
# MASTER .env. There is ONE place to configure everything:
#
#     cp ../.env.example ../.env      # then edit the repo-root .env
#
# Hardhat reads that master automatically (its "Contracts" section: PRIVATE_KEY,
# the *_RPC_URL deploy/fork endpoints, FORK_RPC_URL/FORK_BLOCK, ETHERSCAN_API_KEY).
#
# These are used ONLY for the deliberate, human-authorised deploy/verify step —
# the running detection stack never reads them. If you'd rather keep the deploy
# PRIVATE_KEY out of the shared file, put it in a local `contracts/.env` here
# instead: a component-local `.env` OVERRIDES the master. NEVER commit a real key.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
